## 🚀 CREATWORLD EXTRA TERMS 🚀
## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

By using this Software, you also agree to the following:

1. **THE UNOFFICIAL FAN CLAUSE**  
   If you make something cool with this engine, you are morally (but not legally) 
   obligated to show it to the author. The author will probably say "woah that's awesome" 
   and feel happy. Spread the joy. 🎮

2. **THE NO-EVIL CLAUSE**  
   You may not use this Software to create anything that:
   - Harms innocent virtual or real creatures (pixelated puppies count)
   - Teaches AI to be mean to humans (Skynet is not invited)
   - Intentionally causes physical pain to programmers reading your code
   
   Violation of this clause will result in the author giving you a very disappointed look. 👀

3. **THE COFFEE CLAUSE**  
   If this Software saves you more than 10 hours of development time, 
   you are encouraged (but not required) to buy the author a coffee. 
   Virtual high-fives also accepted. ☕

4. **THE SHAMELESS PLUG CLAUSE**  
   If you use this Software in a public project, a small shoutout or link back 
   to Creatworld would be appreciated but is not required. 
   It helps the engine grow and makes the author do a little happy dance. 💃

5. **THE "I MADE THIS" CLAUSE**  
   You are allowed to say "I made this game with my own hands" even though 
   the engine did most of the heavy lifting. We won't tell anyone. 🤫

6. **THE BUG CLAUSE**  
   This Software comes with approximately 0.5 bugs per 1000 lines. 
   The remaining 0.5 bug is actually a "feature" that adds character. 
   If you find a real bug, the author will try to fix it. Probably. 🐛

7. **THE MIDNIGHT CODING CLAUSE**  
   The author wrote most of this engine between 11 PM and 3 AM. 
   If you find weird variable names or questionable design decisions, 
   that's the reason. No refunds will be issued for lost sleep. 🌙

8. **THE RAINBOW CLAUSE**  
   The particle system may or may not support rainbow colors depending on your monitor's 
   ability to handle true awesomeness. If it doesn't work, try squinting. 🌈

9. **THE ETERNAL GRATITUDE CLAUSE**  
   Thank you for using Creatworld. Seriously. You're awesome. 
   Go make something amazing and show the world what you've created. 🎉

